        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_02",
      "hash64": "D1F1D81ED872B4A1",
      "text": "Así que dudo que esto te suscite la más mínima\\nemoción, pero procedamos de todas formas.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_03",
      "hash64": "D1F1D71ED872B2EE",
      "text": "Esta vez combatiré contra ti en calidad de Líder\\nde Gimnasio con mis Pokémon de siempre.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_04",
      "hash64": "D1F1DA1ED872B807",
      "text": "De tipo Normal... Comunes, convencionales,\\nordinarios... Nada del otro jueves.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_05",
      "hash64": "D1F1D91ED872B654",
      "text": "Pero les tengo mucho apego, ¿sabes? De hecho,\\nle vienen que ni pintados a un tipo tan anodino\\r\\ncomo yo, con poca personalidad.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_06",
      "hash64": "D1F1DC1ED872BB6D",
      "text": "El mundo sería un lugar menos complicado si la\\ngente y los Pokémon fueran más sencillos. Más...\\r\\nnormales.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_07",
      "hash64": "D1F1DB1ED872B9BA",
      "text": "Pero no. Aquí todo el mundo quiere originalidad,\\nextravagancia... Aires de grandeza.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_08",
      "hash64": "D1F1CE1ED872A3A3",
      "text": "En cambio, ¿acaso no reconforta volver a la\\nfamiliaridad del hogar y la rutina para reponerse\\r\\nde la diversión y el ajetreo de las vacaciones?\\c\\nQue se quiten un montón de emociones donde\\nestén unas buenas emociones del montón.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 230,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_09",
      "hash64": "D1F1CD1ED872A1F0",
      "text": "La verdadera fuerza reside en las cosas más\\nsimples.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_10",
      "hash64": "D1EE501ED86F97B2",
      "text": "Uf, demasiadas emociones para un tipo apocado\\ncomo yo.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_11",
      "hash64": "D1EE511ED86F9965",
      "text": "Pero creo haber comprendido algo.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_12",
      "hash64": "D1EE4E1ED86F944C",
      "text": "Ya veo por qué me dijeron que usara Pokémon\\nde tipo Volador como miembro del Alto Mando.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_13",
      "hash64": "D1EE4F1ED86F95FF",
      "text": "Si no sales del camino marcado, te perderás\\nmuchos paisajes pintorescos.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_14",
      "hash64": "D1EE4C1ED86F90E6",
      "text": "A veces viene bien alzar la vista hacia el cielo,\\npara ver a grandes talentos como tú.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_15",
      "hash64": "D1EE4D1ED86F9299",
      "text": "Tampoco es que lo vaya a hacer por afición,\\nno me malinterpretes. Solo cumplo con mi deber.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_16",
      "hash64": "D1EE4A1ED86F8D80",
      "text": "En cualquier caso, hoy no toca hacer horas extra,\\nasí que lo dejamos aquí. Adiós.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
